        "text_H9r4nR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>Soft florals, warm sunlight, and the ease of days spent outdoors.</p><p>Nearly twenty years ago, around this time of year, we found ourselves in a garden, talking about how dresses should feel. Effortless, comfortable, and naturally beautiful, without ever needing to overthink it.</p><p>This collection is inspired by that feeling. Light, flattering pieces designed for garden gatherings, sunny afternoons, and the everyday moments that make summer special.</p><p>As always, we produce in small quantities. Many pieces are already nearly gone, and once they sell out, they will not return.</p><p>With love</p><p>Julia & Anne</p><p>BUY 2 → EXTRA 10% OFF</p><p>BUY 3 → EXTRA 15% OFF + FREE MYSTERY GIFT🎁</p><p>BUY 5+ → EXTRA 25% OFF + FREE MYSTERY GIFT🎁</p><p>Discounts are automatically applied at checkout.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
